<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Nellcor downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Nellcor downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- JP Morgan said analyst Michael Weinstein downgraded the rating on Nellcor Puritan Bennett Inc to market performer from buy.</p>
<p>-- Cited &quot;significantly disappointing fiscal second quarter earnings release,&quot; adding in process of revising earnings model.</p>
<p>-- Company reported operating income of $0.20 per share versus $0.30 a year ago.</p>
<p>-- Said company &quot;continues to stumble from a single-technology company to one offering a broad base of respiratory supplies.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 5-5/8 to 18-1/8.</p>
</text>
